    "homepage": "https://www.muraliwebworld.com/groups/wordpress-plugins-by-muralidharan-indiacitys-com-technologies/forum/topic/category-sub-category-widget-for-wordpress-websites-using-php-javascript-jquer/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>WordPress press widget to list category and subcategories of posts/custom taxonomies of custom post types.</p>\n<p>Features</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>It allows users to add custom icons for category or for subcategory or for custom taxonomies</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>It lists categories and subcategories in user-friendly horizontal pattern. Please refer screenshots.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Category icons can be edited/removed/update with new icons under edit category or under edit custom taxonomy admin screen</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Admin settings of this widget has facility control display on/off for category icons</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Admin settings of this wiget has facility to show/hide count of posts in categories</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Admin settings of this widget has facility to show/hide empty categories in widget</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Title of widget can be customized in widget settings</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Compatible with blocks under widgets section</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>My Links</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.muraliwebworld.com/groups/wordpress-plugins-by-muralidharan-indiacitys-com-technologies/forum/topic/category-sub-category-widget-for-wordpress-websites-using-php-javascript-jquer/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Plugin homepage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/push-notification-for-post-and-buddypress/\" rel=\"ugc\">Push notification plugin for WordPress,BuddyPress and for Mobile apps</a></li>\n<li>Twitter @<a href=\"https://twitter.com/indiacitys\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">indiacitys</a></li>\n<li>Facebook <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/indiacitys\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">indiacitys</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Download this plugin and activate it</p>\n<p>Go to appearence -&gt; Widgets and select Category and subcategory list widget and move to left or right side bar.</p>\n<p>Under widget settings, set appropriate following options,</p>\n<p>Set the required option to show or hide empty categories, show or hide count, select custom taxonomy or default category and Save it</p>\n<p>Set the required option to show/hide category icosn</p>\n<p>Verify it in front end screens in right/left side bar according to your settings.</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='do%20you%20have%20any%20questions%3F'>\nDo you have any questions?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.muraliwebworld.com/groups/wordpress-plugins-by-muralidharan-indiacitys-com-technologies/forum/topic/category-sub-category-widget-for-wordpress-websites-using-php-javascript-jquer/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Please contact us here with your query.</a></p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>7.3</h4>\n<p>Compatible with WordPress 6.9. Tested upto 6.9 WordPress version</p>\n<h4>6.0</h4>\n<p>Update: Category icons upload option will also be available for custom taxonomies and compatible with latest WordPress version 6.1.</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "This widget allows to add/update icons for category or icon for custom taxonomy. It lists Categories in horizontal menu pattern.",
    "description": "<p>WordPress press widget to list category and subcategories of posts/custom taxonomies of custom post types.</p>\n<p>Features</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>It allows users to add custom icons for category or for subcategory or for custom taxonomies</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>It lists categories and subcategories in user-friendly horizontal pattern. Please refer screenshots.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Category icons can be edited/removed/update with new icons under edit category or under edit custom taxonomy admin screen</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Admin settings of this widget has facility control display on/off for category icons</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Admin settings of this wiget has facility to show/hide count of posts in categories</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Admin settings of this widget has facility to show/hide empty categories in widget</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Title of widget can be customized in widget settings</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Compatible with blocks under widgets section</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>My Links</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.muraliwebworld.com/groups/wordpress-plugins-by-muralidharan-indiacitys-com-technologies/forum/topic/category-sub-category-widget-for-wordpress-websites-using-php-javascript-jquer/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Plugin homepage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/push-notification-for-post-and-buddypress/\" rel=\"ugc\">Push notification plugin for WordPress,BuddyPress and for Mobile apps</a></li>\n<li>Twitter @<a href=\"https://twitter.com/indiacitys\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">indiacitys</a></li>\n<li>Facebook <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/indiacitys\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">indiacitys</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
    "download_link": "https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/category-subcategory-list-widget.7.3.zip",
